@SupportDeskAI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5249

# Paste an "id" from the create or list response here:
@ticketId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### FR-01 Create a ticket -> 201
POST {{SupportDeskAI_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Unable to access my account",
  "description": "I reset my password but still cannot sign in."
}

### FR-01 Create an invalid ticket -> 400 with field errors
POST {{SupportDeskAI_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "short"
}

### FR-02 List tickets -> 200
GET {{SupportDeskAI_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Accept: application/json

### FR-02 List with filters (status 0..3, priority 0..3, category text) -> 200
GET {{SupportDeskAI_HostAddress}}/api/tickets?status=0&priority=2&category=Account%20Access
Accept: application/json

### FR-02 Invalid filter -> 400
GET {{SupportDeskAI_HostAddress}}/api/tickets?priority=9
Accept: application/json

### FR-03 Get one ticket -> 200
GET {{SupportDeskAI_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Accept: application/json

### FR-03 Unknown ticket -> 404
GET {{SupportDeskAI_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/3f2b8c1e-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### FR-04 Update a ticket -> 200 (priority: 0 Low, 1 Medium, 2 High, 3 Critical)
PUT {{SupportDeskAI_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Unable to access my account after password reset",
  "description": "I reset my password twice but still cannot sign in.",
  "priority": 2
}

### FR-04 Update with an invalid priority -> 400
PUT {{SupportDeskAI_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Unable to access my account",
  "description": "I reset my password but still cannot sign in.",
  "priority": 7
}

### FR-05 Change status -> 200 (0 Open, 1 InProgress, 2 Resolved, 3 Closed)
PATCH {{SupportDeskAI_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 1
}

### FR-05 Invalid status -> 400
PATCH {{SupportDeskAI_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 9
}

### FR-06 AI analysis -> 200 (saved on the ticket), or 502/503/504 on AI problems
POST {{SupportDeskAI_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/analyze

### FR-07 AI draft reply -> 200 (returned for review only, never saved or sent)
POST {{SupportDeskAI_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/draft-reply

### FR-08 Dashboard summary -> 200
GET {{SupportDeskAI_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/summary
Accept: application/json

###
